{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e02-scene-02",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "蜂蜜柚子茶  (Honey Pomelo Tea)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xie_ling": "谢灵",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Episode 2 of Behind the Scenes. After Xingtian's surprise victory on Twelve Singers, chief producer Chun Yuqiao meets rival producer Xie Ling in a quiet evening lounge over honey pomelo tea. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "约我来干什么呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "不就昨天晚上赢了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不用，我没那习惯。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没给你点咖啡，知道你昨晚睡得不好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "给你点了一杯蜂蜜柚子茶。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "昨晚的十二歌王看了吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "特别好，但是我很好奇。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你把柳凡也安排住这酒店了吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你别装了，赶紧告诉我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我安排她母亲住在这儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "她参加我们的节目，也是一件好事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这么晚打扰了，我先走了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "约我来干什么呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why did you ask me out here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "不就昨天晚上赢了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you not just win last night?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不用，我没那习惯。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No need, I do not have that habit.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没给你点咖啡，知道你昨晚睡得不好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I did not order coffee for you, since I know you slept poorly last night.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "给你点了一杯蜂蜜柚子茶。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I ordered a cup of honey pomelo tea for you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "昨晚的十二歌王看了吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You watched Twelve Singers last night, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "特别好，但是我很好奇。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Very good, though I am really curious.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你把柳凡也安排住这酒店了吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you arrange for Liu Fan to stay at this hotel too?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你别装了，赶紧告诉我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stop pretending and hurry up and tell me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我安排她母亲住在这儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I arranged for her mother to stay here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "她参加我们的节目，也是一件好事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Joining our show is also a good thing for her.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这么晚打扰了，我先走了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sorry to bother you so late; I will head off first.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "约我来干什么呀？",
      "gap": 0.5
