    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Yuqiao reveals how he quietly won singer Liu Fan's trust, though he still has one sharp warning left for Xie Ling. You learned how to order a drink with \"dian\", say 'stop pretending' with \"bie zhuang le\", and take your leave with \"wo xian zou le\". See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
